      "characterSpritePath": "",
      "characterPosition": "",
      "descriptionText": "树不是树。是骨。\n蛋不是蛋。是被忘记的开始。\n根须扎进虚空，树冠托着一个不破的沉默。",
      "autoNextSeconds": 3,
      "options": [],
      "eggDelta": 0,
      "isAnimation": false,
      "animationSpeed": 0
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "backgroundPath": "Images/Backgrounds/0_2",
      "characterSpritePath": "",
      "characterPosition": "",
      "descriptionText": "天是红的，不是夕阳。\n是锈。\n远处有建筑残骸，像被拔掉肋骨的胸腔。\n风声。只有风声。",
      "autoNextSeconds": 3,
      "options": [],
      "eggDelta": 0,
      "isAnimation": false,
      "animationSpeed": 0
    },
        {
      "id": 3,
      "backgroundPath": "Images/Backgrounds/0_3",
      "characterSpritePath": "",
      "characterPosition": "",
      "descriptionText": "建筑是哥特的。尖拱像倒插的肋骨。\n风穿过残存的窗洞，发出不像风的声音 \n——更像有人在很远的地方反复念同一个字。",
      "autoNextSeconds": 3,
      "options": [],
      "eggDelta": 0,
      "isAnimation": false,
      "animationSpeed": 0
    },
        {
      "id": 4,
      "backgroundPath": "Images/Backgrounds/0_4_1",
      "characterSpritePath": "",
      "characterPosition": "",
      "descriptionText": "方舟。或者眼睛。\n",
      "autoNextSeconds": 3,
      "options": [],
      "eggDelta": 0,
      "isAnimation": false,
      "animationSpeed": 0
    },
        {
      "id": 5,
      "backgroundPath": "Images/Backgrounds/0_4_2",
      "characterSpritePath": "",
      "characterPosition": "",
      "descriptionText": "它从红天中降下来，像一个巨人正在缓慢地眨眼。",
      "autoNextSeconds": 3,
      "options": [],
      "eggDelta": 0,
      "isAnimation": false,
      "animationSpeed": 0
    },
            {
      "id": 6,
      "backgroundPath": "Images/Backgrounds/0_4_3",
      "characterSpritePath": "",
      "characterPosition": "",
      "descriptionText": "没有水。没有雨。\n它只是一只空的眼窝,\n它只是一只空的眼窝，在审视一片早已被审判过的土地。",
      "autoNextSeconds": 3,
      "options": [],
